<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia privatises Agricultor trading firm.</title>
<headline>Tunisia privatises Agricultor trading firm.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has sold its majority stake in farm equipment trading firm Agricultor as part of its privatisation programme, stock market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said the 97.02 percent stake was sold to Tunisian businessman Tahar Zarrouk for about nine million dinars.</p>
<p>Agricultor was a subsidiary of state-controlled trading firm Al-Bouniane.</p>
<p>Agricultor's last results showed a 3.73 million dinars loss for 1995 and a total balance sheet net amounting to 34.50 million dinars.</p>
<p>($=1.09 dinar)</p>
</text>
